{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-weixin#card-zh","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-weixin","commit":"16ca866af80e8b95b2d73619579894e817095122","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-weixin 是一个接入 DeepSeek Harness 的微信机器人插件，在 Web 设置页提供扫码绑定和账号连接状态。Host 通过腾讯 iLink API 完成授权与消息长轮询，把已绑定用户的文字及带转写语音交给 Harness 持久会话，并将回答发回微信；支持多个账号、/new、/status 和 /help。适合希望在微信里继续使用 Harness 对话的用户，需要可用的微信机器人账号和运行中的 Harness Web。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-src/client/index.js:556","src/weixin-runtime.mjs:132","src/weixin-bridge.mjs:137"]}
{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-weixin#card-en","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-weixin","commit":"16ca866af80e8b95b2d73619579894e817095122","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-weixin links a Weixin bot with Harness via QR binding in Web settings. The Host polls Tencent iLink, sends messages to persistent Harness sessions, and returns replies. It supports multiple accounts and /new, /status, and /help. Requires an eligible Weixin bot account and Harness Web.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-src/client/index.js:556","src/weixin-runtime.mjs:132","src/weixin-bridge.mjs:137"]}
